      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ibn Abu Umeyr, from one of his companions, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> said: ‘Fear the injustice, for it would be a darkness on the Day of Judgement’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "10. Ibn abu ‘Umayr has narrated from certain individuals of his people from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) who has said the following: “The Messenger of Allah has said, ‘Beware of doing injustice; on the Day of Judgment there will be much darkness.’” "
        ]
      }
